.technologyreview.com/2026/08/31/1143180/hugging-face-hack-could-indicate-cultural-issues-at-openai/</guid><source>MIT Tech Review</source><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 02:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>安全</category><category>开源平台</category></item><item><title>量化触发的语言模型后门：跨量化器迁移与验证-部署差距</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27512</link><description>研究发现后门可在模型量化后触发，且在不同量化器间迁移，验证与部署阶段表现不一致，威胁实际部署安全。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27512</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>安全</category><category>量化</category></item><item><title>Vercel 的 fx 现可用于 AI SDK harness 层</title><link>https://vercel.com/changelog/fx-ai-sdk-harness-adapter</link><description>AI SDK harness 层现已支持 fx，Vercel 的轻量开源代码执行工具，开发者可在 AI 应用中直接运行代码，简化工具调用与 Agent 开发。</description><guid>https://vercel.com/changelog/fx-ai-sdk-harness-adapter</guid><source>Vercel News</source><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>AI SDK</category><category>代码执行</category></item><item><title>英国央行行长警告：AI 估值泡沫与杠杆上升或引发金融危机</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/bank-of-england-chief-warns-that-inflated-ai-valuations-and-rising-leverage-could-trigger-the-next-financial-crisis/</link><description>英国央行行长 Andrew Bailey 向 G20 财长警告，AI 估值过高与杠杆率上升可能触发下一场金融危机，呼吁加强监管。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/bank-of-england-chief-warns-that-inflated-ai-valuations-and-rising-leverage-could-trigger-the-next-financial-crisis/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 02:01:21 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>金融风险</category><category>监管</category></item><item><title>基于向量索引的输出嵌入加速 LLM 推理</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27460</link><description>新方法用向量索引近似输出嵌入，减少 LLM 推理时 softmax 计算量，内存与延迟有望显著下降，具体指标未披露。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27460</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>